Release date: July 25th, 2017

==Beta 0.1.3.7 Patch Notes==

<br>
'''NOTABLE BUGFIXES'''
* Optimised client responsiveness. This aims to address the client freeze, general framerate drops when on or near very large islands, and the degradation of performance over time.
* Significantly reduced memory consumption.
* For those who played the [[Beta 0.1.3.5]] unstable version on the Steam beta branch, 0.1.3.7 fixes the cannon visual duplication bug and the floating island assets bug.
* Version [[Beta 0.1.3.3]] is still available on the Steam beta branch “0.1.3.3” for those who wish to stick with it.

